note err20_pread_text: pread writes its array, so pread into a text is error 20, as for read.
note pwrite from the same text compiles (pwrite_text.om). Up to omc 2c824805 (omega-mv e5b32567)
note the two words were reversed: this compiled and pwrite from a text was error 20.
text t "abc"
fn main to int
r = pread 0 t 0 3 0
ret 0
end
